<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<ui version="4.0">
 <class>RememberAppMonitorConfigForm</class>
 <widget class="QWidget" name="RememberAppMonitorConfigForm">
  <layout class="QVBoxLayout" name="verticalLayout">
   <item>
    <widget class="QLabel" name="label">
     <property name="text">
      <string>&lt;p&gt;Apps and their sections are set in the &lt;b&gt;Remember App Monitor&lt;/b&gt; window: press &lt;b&gt;Meta+Ctrl+M&lt;/b&gt; (change it in System Settings → Keyboard → Shortcuts → KWin → "Remember App Monitor: Open Settings").&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;That window can't receive typing, so apps it can't list or pick can be added here instead, one per line: &lt;b&gt;window class = section&lt;/b&gt; (e.g. &lt;code&gt;steam = maximized&lt;/code&gt;). Lines starting with # are ignored. If an app is also in the window's list, the window's setting wins.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Sections: left, right, top, bottom, top-left, top-right, bottom-left, bottom-right, left-third, center-third, right-third, maximized, center, keep.&lt;/p&gt;</string>
     </property>
     <property name="wordWrap">
      <bool>true</bool>
     </property>
    </widget>
   </item>
   <item>
    <widget class="QPlainTextEdit" name="kcfg_apps">
     <property name="placeholderText">
      <string>steam = maximized</string>
     </property>
    </widget>
   </item>
  </layout>
 </widget>
 <resources/>
 <connections/>
</ui>
